00:04:26,086 --> 00:04:32,086
Being a cop is tough. But in Saigon, 1968, being a cop is crazy.

2
00:08:52,173 --> 00:08:58,173
Off Limits is a action, crime, drama film directed by Christopher Crowe.

3
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:24,260
McGriff and Albaby are probably doing the worst law enforcement
job in the world - they are plain clothes U.S.

4
00:17:44,347 --> 00:17:50,347
military policemen on duty in war-time Saigon.

5
00:22:10,434 --> 00:22:16,434
However, their job becomes even harder when they start
investigating the serial killings of local prostitutes.

6
00:26:36,521 --> 00:26:42,521
Their prime suspect is high ranking U.S.

7
00:31:02,608 --> 00:31:08,608
Army officer which brings their lives in danger.

8
00:35:28,695 --> 00:35:34,695
Buck McGriff, played by Willem Dafoe.

9
